{"id":"9549cff5-43c3-4ec7-89eb-f98584e6ac57","revision":0,"last_node_id":25,"last_link_id":45,"nodes":[{"id":25,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1750,-1450],"size":[720,640],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明（默认双图 Lightning 4步）","properties":{},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653","widgets_values":["# 双图参考编辑 · Qwen-Image-Edit-2511\n\n## 默认：Lightning 极速档\n- 主模型：`qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed.safetensors`\n- 文本编码器：`qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors`，类型 `qwen_image`\n- VAE：`qwen_image_vae.safetensors`\n- 加速 LoRA：`Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors`，强度 1\n- 采样：4 步 / CFG 1 / Euler / simple / denoise 1 / shift 3，沿用 CFGNorm\n- 极速采样、解码、预览、保存已启用，保存前缀 `qwen_edit_fast`\n- 40 步 / CFG 4 画质分支已静音\n\n## 双图输入\n1. image1 = 要编辑的原图。\n2. image2 = 提供人物、服装、材质或风格的参考图。\n3. image3 默认停用，本次不启用。\n4. 提示词明确从图2迁移什么，以及图1保留什么；例如“把图1骑士的盔甲替换为图2的盔甲”。\n5. 输出沿用原尺寸逻辑：按图1比例缩放到最长边 1280，小图也会放大。\n\n## 切回画质档\n仅在需要时启用画质档的 ModelSamplingAuraFlow、KSampler、VAEDecode、SaveImage，并静音极速档的采样、解码、预览、保存四个节点，避免一次同时执行两条分支。\n\n映作工作台的新方案使用参考图编辑 1.1.0；历史 1.0.0 仍使用原 40 步模板。工作台调用固定 API 模板，不会因只保存本文件而自动更新。\n"]},{"id":2,"type":"DiffusionModelLoaderKJ","pos":[-2014.3582385075767,5135.450993293828],"size":[312.095703125,178],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"extra_state_dict","name":"extra_state_dict","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":null},{"localized_name":"model_name","name":"model_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"model_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"weight_dtype","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"compute_dtype","name":"compute_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"compute_dtype"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"patch_cublaslinear","name":"patch_cublaslinear","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"patch_cublaslinear"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sage_attention","name":"sage_attention","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sage_attention"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_